OL,3,GNEWSA'Possible e-bike crash' before
OL,4,Abody found on field
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father found dead by a girl on a
OL,7,Fschool playing field might have died
OL,8,Fafter crashing his e-bike on an uneven
OL,9,Fcanal towpath in bad weather, an
OL,10,Finquest heard.
OL,12,FA narrative conclusion was recorded by
OL,13,Fthe coroner, following the discovery of
OL,14,FNeil Thompson's body by an 11-year-old
OL,15,Fwho was getting ready to do PE at a
OL,16,Fschool in Wolverhampton on 19 January.
OL,18,FPolice originally launched a murder
OL,19,Finvestigation but the hearing was told
OL,20,Fmystery still surrounded exactly how
OL,21,Fthe 45-year-old came to suffer his
OL,22,Ffatal injuries.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
