OL,3,GNEWSA'Possible e-bike crash' before
OL,4,Abody found on field
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was no clear understanding of how
OL,7,Fthe man, from Wolverhampton, got from
OL,8,Fthe towpath to the field where his body
OL,9,Fwas found, the inquest heard.
